I took personal responsibility for meeting my UBS compliance obligations. I proactively reviewed and completed the required affirmations and stayed on top of the actions assigned to me. I applied the same discipline to my engineering responsibilities by following UBS release practices and taking ownership of CubIQ Power BI semantic model changes through production deployment.

When daily reconciliation surfaced upstream data defects, calculation discrepancies, or performance issues, I raised the findings with the relevant stakeholders. As the owner of MRV Builder, I corrected the calculation logic within my remit and followed up on remediation. I ensured that fixes were verified against the agreed acceptance criteria and supported by reconciliation evidence.

